  "label": "Source-audited corrections, Kalam exclusion, and September paper update",
  "kind": "release",
  "description": "31 estimate records corrected, two ineligible Kalam records removed, and study summaries, domains and sample definitions corrected. Contractor and Reyes uses a versioned September PDF and pinned regression extraction. Unsupported Franco SD conversions, Henkel precision and two Lehmann subgroup intervals are unavailable. Bassner gain precision uses observed within-person gain variances with a fixed pooled-pretest-SD approximation. Active collection: 34 studies, 137 records, 110 standardized effects. Default DL pool: 33 estimates from 16 studies, 0.186287 SD, 95% CI [0.123408, 0.249166]. Prior releases and the July PDF are retained.",
